 "remarks": "Really clean quiet unit located on the top floor with nice balcony. New water heater installed in 2022. Newly painted neutral walls and new carpet in 2025. Bath tub received new coating in 2025 as well and new vanity and sink. Spacious one bedroom, large living area, galley kitchen and dining area facing sliding glass doors. Excellent location convenient to train, Merritt Parkway and I-95. Beautiful inground pool with plenty of greenery and picnic area. Walking distance to Restaurants, shopping and medical facilities. One reserved parking spot, 1st one next to the building, additional spots available for second car and guests. Additional storage unit on premises. Stackable washer and dryer located in the unit.",
